# Microdeletion panel BED file
# Format: chr  start  end  syndrome_name  min_bins
# Reference: GRCh37/hg19 coordinates
# Sources: ACMG/ClinGen curated pathogenic microdeletion regions
# 
# IMPORTANT: This panel requires laboratory-specific validation before clinical use.
# Not all microdeletion syndromes have sufficient NIPT performance data.
# Each laboratory must validate sensitivity/specificity for each region.
#
# Recommended minimum requirements per region:
# - Minimum 2 bins fully contained within region
# - Fetal fraction ≥ 8% (stricter than autosomal aneuploidies)
# - Z-score threshold ≥ 5.0

# DiGeorge / Velocardiofacial syndrome (22q11.2)
